# One line-ending convention on every platform. Migrations in particular are
# patched by text replacement in later migrations (014, 016), so CRLF on a
# Windows checkout changes what they do. Keep everything LF in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
